# Episode 1: He's Not My Boyfriend

INT. AAROGYA HOSPITAL, WARD 3 - NIGHT

MEERA (28) opens her eyes. Her left wrist is in a fresh blue cast. She turns her head.

KARTHIK (30) is asleep in the plastic chair beside her bed, a wet helmet on his lap, studio headphones still round his neck.

JYOTHI (40s), the night nurse, checks the drip.

JYOTHI
లేచారా? మీ boyfriend రెండు గంటల నుంచి ఇక్కడే ఉన్నారు.

MEERA
(hoarse)
Nurse... అతను నా boyfriend కాదు.

JYOTHI
Okay.
(beat)
అయితే వెళ్ళిపొమ్మని చెప్పనా?

Meera looks at Karthik.

She says nothing.

A long silence.

Jyothi adjusts the drip and leaves.

Karthik stirs, sees her awake, and is instantly up.

KARTHIK
హే. Water కావాలా?

MEERA
నువ్వు ఇక్కడ ఏం చేస్తున్నావ్?

KARTHIK
(pouring water)
ముందు తాగు. తర్వాత మాట్లాడుదాం.

He holds the cup; she drinks. He cranks the bed up a notch without asking.

KARTHIK (CONT'D)
Flyover మీద scooty జారిందంట. వర్షంలో visor ఎత్తి నడిపావా?

MEERA
...లేదు.

KARTHIK
అబద్ధం.

The corner of her mouth twitches.

INT. WARD 3 - LATER

Karthik tapes her cracked phone screen with surgical tape, careful as a sound edit.

2:40 AM. Karthik dozes upright in the chair, headphones round his neck, one hand resting on the bed rail near her good hand. Not touching.

Meera watches him. Her lips part.

MEERA
(whisper)
Karthik...

He doesn't wake. She doesn't try again.

INT. WARD 3 - DAWN

Grey light. Karthik's phone buzzes on the bedside table. The screen reads "Amma calling".

He glances at Meera. Her eyes are closed. He steps to the window.

KARTHIK
(into phone)
హా అమ్మా... లేదు లేదు, నాకేం కాలేదు. Hospital లో ఉన్నా... ఒకళ్ళకి accident అయింది.

SARALA (V.O.)
ఎవరికి రా?

A beat. He looks back at the bed.

KARTHIK
(into phone)
Office లో ఒకళ్ళు, అమ్మా. Someone from work.

He hangs up. Turns.

Meera's eyes are open. She heard every word.

She looks at the ceiling. Not at him.
